  "id": "ebp",
  "term": "EBP",
  "definition": "EBP stands for evidence-based practice. It is an approach in which practitioners and organisations consult the available evidence to guide interventions, with the expectation that this will improve outcomes and may reduce overall costs, although it can require time and resources that might otherwise go directly to action.",
